These are rules you must abide by when working in the FinaticMTConnector codebase.

When you make changes to connector protocol contracts, signing, replay, state
transitions, or ingestion assumptions, you MUST update the following files:

- `docs/ea-charter.md`
- `docs/oss-bill-of-materials.md`
- `docs/runbooks/stale-connector.md`
- `docs/runbooks/signature-failures.md`
- `docs/runbooks/replay-saturation.md`
- `docs/runbooks/secret-rotation.md`

Use structured JSON logging patterns and never log connector secrets.
